{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21730","headline":"戏赠乐天复言 · 元稹","name":"戏赠乐天复言","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乐事难逢岁易徂，白头光景莫令孤。\n弄涛船更曾观否，望市楼还有会无。\n眼力少将寻案牍，心情且强掷枭卢。\n孙园虎寺随宜看，不必遥遥羡镜湖。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21730.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21730","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}